{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>俄羅斯兩架戰略轟炸機，近日在越南出現。</p><p></p><p>兩架具有核打擊能力的俄羅斯圖-95型戰略轟炸機，周三在越南峴港一個機場出現，周四離開。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.VIET.BOMBER-2300_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026uC6g7liPGx1795107218.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>正值俄羅斯總統普京到深圳出席亞太經合組織(APEC)會議，和中俄美元首會晤等活動，有分析認為，俄方此時派轟炸機到越南，是向外界展示俄方對東亞具有影響力。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.VIET.BOMBER-2300.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026L4INZS5rSL1795107186.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T17:21:14.963844+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T14:54:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T18:35:28.922272+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T17:14:29.261813+00:00","content_hash":"9481eae400efc7063b804a4c1ad5736fd4a3a045c08eb17ac04e3e7846c80a49","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}